            "datePublished": "2024-01-25",
            "reviewBody": "Memorable 4-day journey exploring Ijen, Papuma, Tumpak Sewu, and Bromo. Fredi, our guide, was friendly and accommodating. Each destination had its own charm. Highly recommended!",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
