            },
            "datePublished": "2024-01-17",
            "reviewBody": "A very nice experience. Sam's company is very professional. Every things is well arranged and staff are nice and helpful. Provide us a very remarkable 3D2N volcano experience.\\n\\nOur guide Kiki is have very good English and provide good guidance and briefing to us. We have a very safe ijen night walk.\\n\\nOur diver Fredi is a very nice and caring person. He be with us for whole 3 Day and give us a very comfortable and safe trip.\\n\\nThanks Java Volcano Tour Operator!",
